UID:05e7562d23b311d6e144537cc2a456ae232026_5:05:41_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Graduate & Professional Student Meet Up
LOCATION:168 York Street
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2318466
DESCRIPTION:The Yale LGBTQ Center invites graduate and professional students to join us at 168 York Street Café for an evening of good food, great company, and welcoming vibes.\n\nStop by beginning at 4 PM on October 15 to connect with community and meet new people. Appetizers are on us!\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2318466
END:VEVENT
