UID:cc387b88d455af42af52c749c7e47c55772026_10:50:22_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Queer Creatives: Paint & Sip
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2325266
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate OutWeek with an evening of creativity, connection, and queer joy at the Yale LGBTQ Center! Paint whatever inspires you—no rules, no pressure, and no artistic experience required. Whether you’re channeling your inner artist or simply want to splash some color onto a canvas, we’ll provide the supplies, cozy autumn vibes, and space to express yourself freely.\n\nWarm up with hot cider, enjoy some delicious autumn foods, and create alongside community. Come as you are and leave with something uniquely yours.\n\nFood, drinks, and painting supplies provided!\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2325266
END:VEVENT
