DESCRIPTION:The Late-Bloomers group is a welcoming community for adults ages 25 and older who are exploring, embracing, or reflecting on LGBTQ+ Identity in the later stages of life. Join us on the third Tuesday of each month at the Yale LGBTQ Center (135 Prospect St.) for thoughtful conversations, shared experiences, and meaningful connection in a supportive and inclusive environment. Whether you're newly out, questioning, or simply seeking community with others who understand the journey of living authentically in adulthood, we invite you to come as you are and grow alongside us.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2325279
END:VEVENT
