UID:01b51df5d761d1ec5e4984cc2fbe1bc07132026_11:25:55_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:W{holy} Queer
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2325461
DESCRIPTION:The Chaplain's Office, the Yale LGBTQ Center, and the Slifka Center invite those of all spiritual persuasions and religious traditions to monthly dinner discussions that explore the intersections of all things queer and religious! Come all semester or drop by for one meal. \n\nAll undergrad, graduate, and professional students are welcome!\n \nFor more information, please e-mail our Associate University Chaplain Jenny Peek (jennifer.peek@yale.edu).\n\nRSVP Required.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2325461
END:VEVENT
