LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2325614
DESCRIPTION:Each year we celebrate and honor the achievements of our graduating graduate and professional students in an annual reception.  This year, we invite you to join us in celebrating the class of 2027. This gathering is an opportunity for family, friends, faculty, and staff to recognize the achievements of our graduates.  The Yale LGBTQ Center will be presenting Honor Cords to our graduates as well as connecting them to the GALA Alumni association\n\nREGISTER HERE if you are a graduating G&P student: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd8jBLQSUr-wcIEvRQMVmOdqP5MsyXMoOOdCKi1Koxjd1_d6A/viewform\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2325614
