UID:831c8368618de0bdb27cb3b3768d92707212026_2:35:04_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Autumn Graduate & Professional Mixer
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2325617
DESCRIPTION:The Yale LGBTQ Center (@yalelgbtq), OISS (@yaleoiss), the McDougal Graduate Student Center (@mcdougalgsl) are excited to offer an autumn mixer for Yale Graduate and Professional LGBTQ students! Join us from 5:30 pm to 7:30 pm on Friday, September 11th in the Caulkins Courtyard located behind the Watson Center. \n\nWe hope you will stop by to make some new friends and reconnect with old ones as we celebrate our community and welcome in the new school year. We are pleased to provide craft beers as well as non-alcoholic options! (Must be 21+ to drink alcohol: if you would like to, please bring a government ID.) See you there!\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2325617
END:VEVENT
