UID:1c8686ded5a76af292a33e670ea6eaee8202026_2:49:46_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:2026 New Haven Pride 
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2326649
DESCRIPTION:🏳️‍🌈 New Haven Pride Festival💫\n\nJoin the Yale LGBTQ Center crew as we head to the New Haven Pride Fest together! Whether you're new to campus or a seasoned Pride pro, come walk with us, connect with community, and celebrate in full color.\n\n🗓 Saturday, October 3\n⏰ 12 PM\n📍 50 Orange St, New Haven, CT 06510\n🎉 Pride Fest runs from 12–4 PM\n\n✨ Come as you are—bring friends, flags, sunscreen, and your Pride spirit!\n\n#NewHavenPride #YaleLGBTQCenter #Pride2026 #QueerYale #LGBTQYale #PrideParadeVibes #YaleToPride \n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2326649
END:VEVENT
