UID:fb17900f15b76d7bac20bb81b717bdd29172026_4:45:19_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Graduate & Professional Student Mixer: Pride & Provisions
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331398
DESCRIPTION:Join the Yale LGBTQ Center and Yale Divinity School for Pride & Provisions, a relaxed evening mixer for graduate and professional students from across Yale.\n\nStop by the Yale LGBTQ Center for wine, beer, cheese, and light provisions while meeting students from across Yale’s graduate and professional schools. Whether you’re looking to make new connections, catch up with friends, or spend some time in community, all Yale G&P students are welcome.\n\nFriday, November 13, 2026 | 5–7 PM\nYale LGBTQ Center | 135 Prospect Street\n\nPresented by the Yale LGBTQ Center in partnership with the Office of Community Engagement and the Office of Student Affairs at Yale Divinity School.\n\nWe hope you will stop by to make some new friends and reconnect with old ones as we celebrate our community and welcome in the new school year. We are pleased to provide craft beers as well as non-alcoholic options! (Must be 21+ to drink alcohol: if you would like to, please bring a government ID.) See you there!\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331398
END:VEVENT
