URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331568
DESCRIPTION:CTGMC hosts BingoMania!, an off-campus LGBTQ community event featuring an evening of bingo hosted by Kiki Lucia. Join CTGMC on Saturday, September 19, 2026, at The Annex Club in New Haven. Doors open at 6:00 PM, and games begin at 7:00 PM. Admission is $25 cash only and includes 12 regular games; additional special games are $1 each. Learn more at ctgmc.org/bingomania. Hosted by CTGMC. This event is being amplified by the Yale LGBTQ Center; the Center is not the event host or organizer.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331568
