SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Come get Schooled @SWEAT
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331569
DESCRIPTION:Butch Queens presents Come get Schooled @SWEAT, an off-campus LGBTQ dance party at Partners Cafe in New Haven. The final SWEAT installment of 2026 features house music from DJ Sabi, Chris Gallo, and Jon Blanchard. The event is for ages 21+ and runs from 10:00 PM Saturday, September 19, through 2:00 AM Sunday, September 20.\n\nHosted and organized by Butch Queens. This off-campus LGBTQ event is being amplified by the Yale LGBTQ Center; the Center is not the host or organizer.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331569
