SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Let’s Have a Kiki (New Haven)
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331571
DESCRIPTION:Kiki Lucia presents Let’s Have a Kiki, an off-campus LGBTQ drag and variety show at Partners Cafe in New Haven. Hosted and produced by Kiki Lucia, the long-running monthly show features regional drag artists, gender-bending performers, and burlesque performers. The series celebrates 10 years at Partners Cafe in 2026. Music for this edition is by DJ Chris Gallo.\n\nJoin the show Friday, September 25, from 10:00 PM–2:00 AM. 21+ and no cover.\n\nHosted and produced by Kiki Lucia. This off-campus LGBTQ event is being amplified by the Yale LGBTQ Center; the Center is not the host or organizer.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331571
END:VEVENT
