UID:ab0773af3cec8cedb81e19d59f22b3e79182026_12:59:30_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:BingoMania! 
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331584
DESCRIPTION:The Connecticut Gay Men’s Chorus (CTGMC) presents BingoMania!, its monthly off-campus LGBTQ drag bingo event at The Annex Club in New Haven. Doors open at 6:00 PM and games begin at 7:00 PM. Admission is $25 cash only and includes 12 regular bingo games; additional special games are $1 each. Beverages and snacks are available for purchase, and attendees may bring their own food. The event page notes cash prizes of up to $2,500.\n\nSeating is first-come, first-served. Attendees who want to hold a place in line may arrive after 4:15 PM to receive a number, but they must return before 6:00 PM and a number does not guarantee a seat.\n\nHosted by the Connecticut Gay Men’s Chorus. This off-campus LGBTQ community event is being amplified by the Yale LGBTQ Center; the Center is not the host or organizer.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331584
END:VEVENT
