UID:dc3fc3c89b31e2d855c5d00c2d2af5259182026_1:03:28_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:OutPro LGBTQ+ Professional Networking Social — Connecticut
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331586
DESCRIPTION:Out Professionals presents an off-campus LGBTQ+ professional networking social at Barracuda Bistro & Bar in New Haven. LGBTQ+ professionals, business owners, self-employed professionals, companies, and supportive allies are invited to make connections across industries and career stages. OutPro’s color-coded industry badges help attendees identify people working in fields relevant to them. Complimentary appetizers will be available during the private event, with drinks available for individual purchase. Attendees who park at the nearby Crown Street Garage can receive a parking voucher from Barracuda Bistro & Bar when they leave.\n\nHosted by Out Professionals / OutPro Connecticut. This off-campus LGBTQ+ event is being amplified by the Yale LGBTQ Center; the Center is not the host or organizer.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2331586
END:VEVENT
