UID:5c88da5d93cb7e36ab8747bb017829189292026_1:15:44_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Queer Tables: Queer Italian Pasta
LOCATION:Yale LGBTQ Center Café, 135 Prospect Street, New Haven 06511, United States
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2333773
DESCRIPTION:Come when you can, leave when you must. All are welcome at our table – undergrads, grad students, faculty and staff! \n\nThis is a relaxed and fun place for finding queer joy, chatting across languages, and sharing a small, yummy meal. \n\nThe pasta dish is cooked in the LGBTQ Center's kitchen and varies session by session. Vegan and gluten-free options are always available, and we do our best to accommodate any other dietary requirements.\n\nQueer Italian Pasta is hosted by the Italian Studies Department and LGBTQ Center. Registration is not necessary.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2333773
END:VEVENT
