UID:11641a4fdb164fd7dd9d0262252654bd9292026_3:30:18_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Book Talk: A reading of Black Tidal Tales
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2333796
DESCRIPTION:Join beyond-disciplinary artist Shekinah for A reading of Black Tidal Tales, a journey through the relationships between the Black African Diaspora and the Ocean across time and space. Guided by storytelling, embodiment, and love, this program invites attendees into an exploration shaped by the currents that connect diaspora and ocean.\n\nFriday, November 6 at 7 PM at Yale LGBTQ Center’s Stonewall Library, 135 Prospect Street, New Haven, CT.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2333796
END:VEVENT
