SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:A Queer Spirituality After Religious Harm: Mental Health Implications and Paths Forward
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335021
DESCRIPTION:Join Dr. Joel Hollier of Sydney, Australia for a conversation on queer spirituality, religious harm, mental health, and paths forward.\n\nThe program will take place on Tuesday, October 13, 2026, from 10:30 AM–12:30 PM at the Yale Program for Recovery and Community Health (PRCH), with a virtual participation option also available. A light lunch will follow the program.\n\nRegistration is free.\n\nThis LGBTQ-focused event is being amplified by the Yale LGBTQ Center.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335021
END:VEVENT
