UID:972f6ac814cfc8d4baa3b85b49cd53501072026_7:58:44_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Advance Screening: CLUB KID (2026)
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335023
DESCRIPTION:1. Join us for an advance screening of A24’s CLUB KID (2026), written and directed by Jordan Firstman.\nFeatured at the 2026 Cannes Film Festival, the film follows partied-out New York City club promoter Peter, played by Jordan Firstman, whose whirlwind lifestyle is upended by the arrival of the 10-year-old son he never knew he had.\nDCP | 2026 | Directed by Jordan Firstman | US | 122 minutes | English\nThe screening is free and open to the public. No registration is required. Please arrive early to secure a seat.\nPresented by Women’s, Gender, and Sexuality Studies, LGBTQ Studies, the Yale LGBTQ Center, and Yale Film Society.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335023
END:VEVENT
