UID:87f1f3abc4507be7879b7c7b779310cc10132026_3:15:18_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:International Trick-Or-Treat & Costume Contest
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335868
DESCRIPTION:If you've never had the chance to participate in an American Halloween, now is your chance! Join us for our bigger than ever annual International Trick-or-Treat Tour for an opportunity to dress-up and participate in one of our favorite childhood past-times of receiving free candy. Halloween is one of OISS' favorite holidays of the year and we want it to be yours too!\n\nOISS has partnered up with Graduate Housing, MacMillan Center, McDougal GSL, Office of Career Strategy, Office of LGBTQ Resources, Yale China, and the Yale Police Department for a trick-or-treat tour on this side of campus! Each of our offices will have stations set-up where you can stop by in costume, say "Trick-Or-Treat", and get some Halloween candy.\n\nCostumes for this event are HIGHLY encouraged (basically required), as this is the whole point of Halloween and Trick-Or-Treating! The OISS team is busy preparing our costumes as we speak…\n\nYou must register to attend (to help us prepare candy) and families and children are welcome - open to the Yale Community! \n\nDetails about the trick-or-treat route will be sent to those who register for the event a day or two before the event.\n\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335868
END:VEVENT
