UID:7c5b7e785b2b9a88f36b97127b96eed811122026_6:44:00_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Button Making and Pizza!!!
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2338992
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of creativity, connection, and self-expression as we transform scraps into statements! At this event, we’ll be making wearable art using magazine clippings, drawings, and collage materials to design one-of-a-kind buttons that reflect our interests, identities, and beliefs.\n\nSupplies will be included, but feel free to bring your own clippings/pictures to be made into a button!\n\nPizza and drinks provided!!!!\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2338992
END:VEVENT
